WEBVTT
X-TIMESTAMP-MAP=LOCAL:00:00:00.000,MPEGTS:0

1
00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:05.900
Iyi videwo isobanura ibisanzwe kandi bidasanzwe fondal red reflex igaragara.

2
00:00:07.570 --> 00:00:19.370
Isuzuma risanzwe ryumutuku ritukura ni mugihe nta tandukaniro rusange ryumucyo namabara hagati y'amaso yombi hamwe na corneal yo hagati.

3
00:00:20.810 --> 00:00:31.530
Ndetse isura isanzwe ya refleks ya fondasiyo, ariko, iratandukana bitewe nigihe uri kure n’aho umwana areba.

4
00:00:31.910 --> 00:00:42.010
Nibizamini bikora cyane aho ugomba kwimuka kuruhande no inyuma no imbere muburebure bwikiganza kuva umurwayi.

5
00:00:42.010 --> 00:00:51.350
Abana n'abana nabo bazunguruka amaboko n'amaso, bigatuma reflex ihindura uburyo isa mugihe cyo gukora ikizamini.

6
00:00:51.910 --> 00:01:02.350
Mumwana wumukara, reflex isanzwe isa neza, ifite umuhondo numweru ndetse rimwe na rimwe nubururu nkibara nyamukuru.

7
00:01:02.350 --> 00:01:14.970
Icyangombwa, mugisuzuma gisanzwe, ntihakagombye kubaho itandukaniro rusange mumucyo namabara hagati y'amaso yombi hamwe na corneal yo hagati.

8
00:01:15.890 --> 00:01:23.850
Reflex idasanzwe ni mugihe hari itandukaniro rihoraho, itandukaniro nyaryo mumucyo namabara hagati y'amaso yombi.

9
00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:35.840
Kwimura corneal yimuwe, igicucu cyijimye kiboneka muri refleks yijisho rimwe cyangwa amaso yombi, cyangwa reflex itukura rwose.

10
00:01:37.670 --> 00:01:56.330
Ikizamini kidasanzwe gishobora kwerekana ko hariho cataracte, retinoblastoma, inkovu za corneal, squint, ikosa ryangiritse cyangwa ibibazo byavutse nka coloboma.

11
00:01:56.970 --> 00:02:01.690
Ibi byose bisaba ko hasuzumwa izindi mpuguke.

12
00:02:02.650 --> 00:02:10.900
Reba iyi reflex hanyuma wibaze: ibi nibisanzwe cyangwa bidasanzwe? Ibisubizo bizakurikiraho nyuma.

13
00:03:35.020 --> 00:03:45.840
Ugomba noneho kumva neza uko refleks isanzwe isa, kimwe na refleks idasanzwe, kandi ukabasha gutanga igitekerezo gishoboka.
